  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Election Observation and Civic Education in Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project has two phases. The first phase focused on July 31, 2013 harmonised elections in Zimbabwe. The second phase is concentrating on civic education up to December 2014. This initial phase has already been completed and now the focus is on civic education. The idea is to utilise the opportunities presented by the coming of the new constitution to then raise awareness amongst citizens so that people begin to engage relevant stakeholders so as to realise their rights enshrined in the new constitution. The project will be implemented in all the eight dioceses of the Catholic church in Zimbabwe through the CCJP strictures.</narrative>
  </description>
